1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,110
马斯克说：
Elon Musk says:

2
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:04,450
到2029年，天上的AI算力要碾压地面。
by 2029, AI computing in orbit will crush computing on the ground.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,040
据报道，他预计2028年底左右，
Reportedly, he expects that around the end of 2028,

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,740
太空每月新增的算力就会超过地面。
new computing added in space each month will pass the ground.

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,710
听起来很美：太空零下两百七十度，
Sounds great: space is minus two hundred seventy degrees,

6
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:14,500
一台天然的大冰箱！
a giant free fridge!

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,070
今天的烧脑问题：
Today's brain teaser:

8
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,930
太空那么冷，显卡凭啥会热死？
space is so cold, so how can a GPU overheat?

9
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,510
先认识主角：小芯，
Meet our hero, Chip,

10
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,870
一块AI显卡。
an AI graphics card.

11
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,650
它一干活，
When it works,

12
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,660
一块就要吃掉大约七百瓦。
one card eats about seven hundred watts.

13
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,780
吃进去的电，
Almost all that electricity

14
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,570
几乎全都变成了热。
turns into heat.

15
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,520
在地上，热是怎么走的？
On the ground, how does heat leave?

16
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:30,350
靠空气。
Through the air.

17
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,510
风扇一吹，热空气被赶走，
A fan blows the hot air away,

18
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:33,890
冷空气补进来。
and cool air rushes in.

19
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:35,350
机房再加上水冷，
Add water cooling,

20
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:37,280
热就被一路搬到室外。
and the heat is carried all the way outside.

21
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,790
反转一：太空里，
Twist one: in space,

22
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:39,860
没有空气。
there is no air.

23
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:42,000
没有空气，风扇转得再快，
With no air, however fast the fan spins,

24
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,020
也是白转。
it moves nothing.

25
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,370
太空不是冰箱，
Space is not a fridge.

26
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:45,840
是一个保温瓶。
It is a thermos.

27
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,290
保温瓶为啥保温？
Why does a thermos keep things hot?

28
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,040
夹层里抽成了真空。
The gap in its wall is a vacuum.

29
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,770
热没法靠碰传出去，
Heat cannot leave by touching,

30
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:52,040
也没法靠吹。
or by blowing.

31
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:52,870
冷是真冷，
The cold is real,

32
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,820
可那份冷根本碰不到你。
but it never touches you.

33
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,420
那热还剩哪条路？
So what way out is left for heat?

34
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,140
发光。
Glowing.

35
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:59,640
所有东西都在发看不见的红外光，
Everything gives off invisible infrared light,

36
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:00,750
你我也在发。
including you and me.

37
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:02,830
其实你在黑夜里也在发光，
You glow in the dark too.

38
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:05,030
热成像相机拍到的就是它。
A thermal camera sees exactly that.

39
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,100
这叫热辐射，
This is thermal radiation,

40
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,990
是太空里唯一的出路。
the only exit in space.

41
00:01:07,990 --> 00:01:09,480
反转二：这条路，
Twist two: this exit

42
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,530
窄得吓人。
is shockingly narrow.

43
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:12,860
国际空间站有好几大片散热板，
The space station has several big radiator panels.

44
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:16,310
据NASA资料，最多也就散掉约七十千瓦。
According to NASA, they shed at most about seventy kilowatts.

45
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:17,660
七十千瓦是多少？
How much is seventy kilowatts?

46
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,990
估算一下：大约一百块显卡。
A rough estimate: about one hundred GPUs.

47
00:01:19,990 --> 00:01:21,620
而一个大型AI机房，
And a big AI data center

48
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:23,380
动不动就是几十万块。
can hold hundreds of thousands.

49
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:24,020
怎么办？
What to do?

50
00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:25,590
让散热板更烫一点。
Make the radiators hotter.

51
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,250
发光散热有个规律：
Glowing follows a rule:

52
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:30,130
绝对温度翻一倍，散热变十六倍。
double the absolute temperature, and the heat shed goes up sixteen times.

53
00:01:30,130 --> 00:01:31,640
这叫四次方定律：
It is the fourth power law:

54
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,260
温度自己乘四遍。
temperature multiplied by itself four times.

55
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:34,450
可显卡怕烫，
But GPUs hate heat.

56
00:01:34,450 --> 00:01:35,750
它热不起来。
They cannot run that hot.

57
00:01:35,750 --> 00:01:36,570
小芯表示：
Chip says:

58
00:01:36,570 --> 00:01:38,160
我只想要一台风扇。
all I want is a fan.

59
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:40,240
所以散热板只能做得巨大，
So the radiators must be huge,

60
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,920
大得像一对对翅膀。
like giant pairs of wings.

61
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:44,920
空间站上那些白色的大板子就是散热板，
On the space station, the big white panels are radiators,

62
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,210
不是太阳能板。
not solar panels.

63
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:47,890
反转三，最反直觉：
Twist three, the strangest:

64
00:01:47,890 --> 00:01:49,500
太阳还在帮倒忙。
the Sun makes it worse.

65
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,020
太空里没有云挡着，
In space no clouds block the Sun.

66
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:53,320
向阳的一面能晒到一百多度。
The sunny side can bake above one hundred degrees.

67
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,220
所以散热板得侧着身子，
So the radiators turn edge on,

68
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:56,210
躲着太阳。
dodging the Sun.

69
00:01:56,210 --> 00:01:57,670
那马斯克图什么？
Then why does Musk want it?

70
00:01:57,670 --> 00:01:59,430
图的恰恰就是太阳。
Exactly for the Sun.

71
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:01,700
合适的轨道上几乎一直有太阳，
In the right orbit, sunlight is almost nonstop:

72
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:03,440
没有黑夜，没有阴天。
no night, no cloudy days.

73
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,670
电几乎白来，
Nearly free power,

74
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,640
也不用抢地、抢水。
and no fight over land or water.

75
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,830
地上的大机房，
Some big data centers on the ground

76
00:02:07,830 --> 00:02:10,010
有的要用大量的水来降温。
use lots of water for cooling.

77
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:11,360
说白了是一笔账：
It comes down to a trade:

78
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:14,180
省下的电，能不能抵掉散热的麻烦。
can the power saved pay for the cooling trouble?

79
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:17,420
友情提示：2029的时间表是马斯克的预测，
Fine print: the 2029 timeline is Musk's prediction.

80
00:02:17,420 --> 00:02:20,020
还没有人在太空建成大型AI机房。
Nobody has built a large AI data center in space yet.

81
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:21,570
一百块显卡是估算，
One hundred GPUs is an estimate,

82
00:02:21,570 --> 00:02:25,140
十六倍是物理规律，都不是哪家公司的方案。
sixteen times is physics. Neither is any company's design.

83
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:28,220
所以，太空那么冷，显卡凭啥会热死？
So why can a GPU overheat in freezing space?

84
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:31,060
因为冷碰不到它，热也甩不出去。
Because the cold can't touch it, and the heat can't get out.

85
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:33,320
太空是全宇宙最大的保温瓶。
Space is the biggest thermos in the universe.

86
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:36,280
显卡上去，可别被泡成一杯热茶。
Send a GPU up there, and don't let it steep like hot tea.

